:: Fae Dragon Molestation
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>
	<<molested>>

	<<beastCombatInit>><<set $enemytrust -= 40>><<set $enemyanger += 40>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<effects>>
<<effectsman>>

<br>
<<beast $enemyno>>
<br><br>
<<stateman>>
<br><br>
<<actionsman>>
<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fae Dragon Molestation Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fae Dragon Molestation Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fae Dragon Molestation]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Fae Dragon Molestation Finish

<<effects>>

<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>

	<<beastejaculation>>

	Satisfied, the <<beasttype>> returns to its abode.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Next time I might take you with me, squishy," <<bhe>> coos.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you continue on your way.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Fae Realm]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>

	You scare the mighty <<beasttype>>. <<bHe>> flees deeper into the forest.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Not so tiny! Not so squishy!" <<bhe>> yells as <<bhe>> runs.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you continue on your way.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Fae Realm]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

