:: Fae Rabbit Molestation Finish

<<effects>>

<<if $enemyarousal gte $enemyarousalmax>>

	<<beastejaculation>>

	Satisfied, the <<beasttype>> hops back into the forest.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Breed, yes breed, good breed," <<bhe>> purrs.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you continue on your way.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Fae Realm]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif $enemyhealth lte 0>>

	You scare the mighty <<beasttype>>. <<bHe>> flees deeper into the forest.
	<<if $monster is 1>>
		"Mmm breed later, not breed now, breed," <<bhe>> squeals as <<bhe>> hops away.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<tearful>> you continue on your way.
	<br><br>

	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>

	<<link [[Next|Fae Realm]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>

:: Fae Dragon Vore
<<effects>>
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<set $combat to 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<set $enemytype to "vore">>
	<<set $vorestage to 1>>
	<<set $vorestrength to 1>><<set $position to "doggy">>
	<<resetLastOptions>>
	<<getCombatDefaultsType>>
<</if>>
<<voreeffects>>
<<vore>>
<<voreactions>>
<<if $stress gte $stressmax or $vorestage lte 0 or $vorestomach gte 5>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fae Dragon Vore Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fae Dragon Vore]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Fae Dragon Vore Finish

<<effects>>
<<if $stress gte $stressmax or $vorestomach gte 5>>
	It's all just too much for you. You pass out.
	<br><br>
	<<if $upperoff isnot 0>>
		<<upperruined>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $loweroff isnot 0>>
		<<lowerruined>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $underloweroff isnot 0>>
		<<underlowerruined>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $underupperoff isnot 0>>
		<<underupperruined>>
	<</if>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|Passout Fae]]>><<pass 1 hour>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<tearful>> you haul yourself out of the dragon's maw. It decides against pursuing you further, and disappears back into the depths.
	<br><br>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|Fae Realm]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Fae Fairy Swarm
<<if $molestationstart is 1>>
	<<set $molestationstart to 0>>
	<<molested>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<set $combat to 1>>
	<<set $enemytype to "swarm">>

	<<swarminit "fairies" "swarm" "moving towards you" "encircle you" "fend off" 1 9>>
	<<set $timer to 8>>
<</if>>
<<effects>><<swarmeffects>>
<<swarm>>
<<swarmactions>>
<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fae Fairy Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<elseif $timer lte 0>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fae Fairy Finish]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fae Fairy Swarm]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>

:: Fae Fairy Finish
<<effects>>
<<if $stress gte $stressmax>>
	It's all just too much for you. You pass out.
	<br><br>
	<<if $upperoff isnot 0>>
		<<upperruined>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $loweroff isnot 0>>
		<<lowerruined>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $underloweroff isnot 0>>
		<<underlowerruined>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $underupperoff isnot 0>>
		<<underupperruined>>
	<</if>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|Passout Fae]]>><<pass 1 hour>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<<tearful>> you swat away the last fairy who flies away with a hiss. They disappear into the forest.
	<br><br>
	<<clotheson>>
	<<endcombat>>
	<<link [[Next|Fae Realm]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>

:: Passout Fae
<<location "forest">>
You feel yourself collapse to the soft yellow grass but something is wrong... Everything goes black.
<br><br>
You wake up hours later to the light of morning. You rub your head and find yourself inside the hollowed out tree where you started. Was it all just a dream?
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Forest]]>><<pass 360>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>